{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Hardware"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about hardware."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Understands systems theories, business processes and basic concepts on IT.   Create a map of processes that allows identifying areas in an information system, using IT tools to generate reports based on the company's needs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  Recognizes basic ideas on IT concepts, systems theory, and diagrams of processes."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n1le02ob04re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Present Continuous for Current Events"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use the <b>present continuous</b> to refer to current actions happening at the moment of speaking or that are temporary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the <b>present continuous</b> to express the idea that something is happening right now. It is important to follow the structure for this tense: </br></br><center>Subject + <b>verb \u2018to be' (am / is / are*)</b> + <b>verb in-ING form</b>.</center></br></br>*Remember that we conjugate the verb \u2018to be' according to the subject of the sentence.  Check the following chart:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Hello class, this week we are learning about computer systems, so today I am making this presentation to you about a very important topic, which is hardware. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "When we talk about hardware, we are referring to all the electrical, mechanical, and electronic components of a computer system. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>PRONOUN\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>CONJUGATION OF VERB 'TO BE'\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>am\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>He / She / It\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>is\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>You / We / They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>are\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:</br><i>I <b>am learning</b> about hardware in this class. </br>She <b>is working</b> for this hardware company. </br>They <b>are talking</b> about the definition of hardware. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "What Is Hardware?   "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "The <b>hardware</b> in a computer is the group of physical components that form the system. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "We can define hardware as the important physical parts of any system. Some of the common hardware components of any computer system are the motherboard, monitor, keyboard, hard disk drive (HDD), graphic cards, sound cards, and memory (RAM), among others. </br></br> The hardware is the collection of all the parts that you can physically touch, change, or manipulate. Let's check the functions of some of the hardware components we checked above:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>HARDWARE\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>FUNCTIONS\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>Motherboard\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is the most important component as it contains important circuits and chips that run the software. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>Monitor\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The screen in which we can see all the outcome of the system. On it we can see the applications, videos, and pictures that come from the system. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>Keyboard\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The element you use to type in information to the system. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>Computer data storage\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A hard drive that saves all the important information of the system. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>Data storage devices\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"External devices that save data, such as USB drives, CDs, and DVDs. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>Graphic card\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A card that controls and runs graphics such as pictures, videos, or animations.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b><center>Sound card\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A card that controls and runs the sound of the system, such as the audio in music, videos, among others. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "circuit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an electric system "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That is to say that all the internal circuits and components that make a computer work are basically its hardware."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le02ob04aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "upgrade"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make something better by changing some of its parts"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Plus, as these are elements that we can physically touch, we can change and upgrade them at any time to have a better computer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le02ob04aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wonder"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask to yourself"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can see that many of you are wondering about the components we can find in most computer system units."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le02ob04aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "storage"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the capacity to save information for later use"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Those data storage units save all the important data and information of the system."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le02ob04aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "manage"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to control; to manipulate"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Example: And this sound card over here, manages all the sound."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le02ob04aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of all the hardware devices you know."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a chart with the categories: internal devices, input devices and output devices."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Put all 