"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "enpe8n1le02ob04re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "id": 12}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n1le02ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n1le02ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<div align=\"justify\">Hello class, this week we are learning about computer systems, so today I am making this presentation to you about a very important topic, which is hardware. When we talk about hardware, we are referring to all the electrical, mechanical, and electronic components of a computer system. That is to say that all the internal circuits and components that make a computer work are basically its hardware. Plus, as these are elements that we can physically touch, we can change and upgrade them at any time to have a better computer."}, {"time": "36000", "image": "enpe8n1le02ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<div align=\"justify\">I can see that many of you are wondering about the components we can find in most computer system units. Well, today many companies are producing a series of different computer systems, like laptops, tablets or desktop computers. However, these all have some basic components in common. Let's check some of them. This motherboard contains all the important circuits of the system; those data storage units save all the important data and information of the system; that graphic card controls all the graphics of the system; and this sound card over here, manages all the sound."}, {"time": "77000", "image": "enpe8n1le02ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<div align=\"justify\">Now, there is something that complements the computer system and that we need to include so it works properly. We are talking about the peripheral devices, which we divide into two different categories. One of them is input devices, which we use to enter information into the system. For example, I am writing on this keyboard to type in letters, symbols, and numbers. We also have output devices, which project or reproduce information to the user; check, for example, this projector that we are using over here."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n1le02ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}